## Bilateral cue audition — 45 seconds
## extended syntax: entrain
## The same pitch control, level and left/right timing for each sound.
## Listen for the tone, then the bell, then the soft noise burst.
## Copy any one of these voice lines into another session.

-changeover 1
off: -
tone: emdr:420/18 rate0.8 shape=tone
bell: emdr:420/18 rate0.8 shape=bell
noise: emdr:420/18 rate0.8 shape=noise

00:00:00 off
00:00:01 tone
00:00:15 bell
00:00:30 noise
00:00:45 off
